@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8100
@tenantKey = REPLACE_WITH_PRIVATE_ALPHA_KEY
@jobId = REPLACE_WITH_RESPONSE_ID

### Database health (no key required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Submit CSV. Reuse this key only with exactly the same bytes.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantKey}}
Content-Type: text/csv
Idempotency-Key: demo-import-001

sku,name,quantity
PEN-001,Synthetic blue pen,12
NOTEBOOK-001,Synthetic notebook,5

### Job state
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/imports/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantKey}}

### Validation errors (maximum 50 entries)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/imports/{{jobId}}/errors
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantKey}}

### Durable state transitions
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/imports/{{jobId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantKey}}

### First job page. Feed next_cursor into after.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/imports?limit=20&after=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantKey}}

### Current record effects
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/records?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantKey}}

### Cancellation may return 409 if the worker already committed
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/imports/{{jobId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantKey}}
